sequenceDiagram
    participant P as 玩家
    participant F as 客户端反馈表单
    participant Q as 本地待发队列
    participant V as FeedbackCreateAPIView
    participant S as FeedbackService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    P->>F: 填写并提交反馈
    F->>F: 组装 anon_id + client_version + 字段 + 附件
    alt 离线
        F->>Q: 入队(本地持久化)
        Note over Q: 联网后由队列自动补传
    end
    Q->>V: POST /api/feedback/ (multipart)
    V->>V: FeedbackSerializer 校验
    alt 校验失败
        V-->>F: 400 + 错误字段
    else 校验通过
        V->>S: create_ticket(anon_id, data)
        S->>DB: get_or_create(Player, anon_id)
        S->>DB: create(FeedbackTicket, player=...)
        S-->>V: 工单
        V-->>F: 201 + ticket_id
    end
    F-->>P: 提示"反馈已提交"
